cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the software repository and consult docs/RESEARCH_STATUS.md
  before citing any experimental result. The research campaign is incomplete
  and the reported dev-100 continuation results used a non-frozen backend.
title: NOVA-Mem
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/zafaraieng/nova-mem"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
keywords:
